      <h2 id="registry-viewing-logs_accessing-the-registry" class="group scroll-mt-20">Viewing registry logs<a href="#registry-viewing-logs_accessing-the-registry" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">You can view the logs for the registry by using the <code>oc logs</code> command.</p>
      <p><strong>Procedure</strong></p>
      <ul>
      <li>
      Use the <code>oc logs</code> command with deployments to view the logs for the container image registry. Example output provided for demonstrative purposes.
